      "source_number": "902",
      "independent_solution": "a: t=5x-1 gives 5x+1=t+2 and t^2+6t+5=(t+1)(t+5)=0. t=-1,-5 give x=0,-4/5. b: t=x^2-9 gives (t-1)(t-7)=0; x^2=10,16 gives {-4,-sqrt(10),sqrt(10),4}. c: t=2a^2+3a gives (t-2)(t-5)=0. Inner factorizations (2a-1)(a+2) and (2a+5)(a-1) give {-5/2,-2,1/2,1}. d: t=(y+1)^2+3 gives (t-3)(t-4)=0. The branches (y+1)^2=0,1 give {-2,-1,0}; -1 is repeated but listed once.",
