      "independent_solution": "a: (sqrt(30)-6)/sqrt(15)=sqrt(2)-2sqrt(15)/5=(5sqrt(2)-2sqrt(15))/5. b: 5sqrt(3)+3sqrt(5)=sqrt(5)(sqrt(15)+3), and the denominator is positive, so the quotient is sqrt(5).",
