      "independent_solution": "On the specified closed symmetric domain[-a,a], a>=0, the range of1.7x^2 is[0,1.7a^2]. Thus1.7a^2=6.8 gives a=2 and the domain[-2,2]. An asymmetric domain with the same range is not admissible, and opening the endpoints loses attainment of6.8.",
